    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 270,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "text" : "[Father Rubalkabara]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 271,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "text" : "I guess there's really no need for me to teach you much. Besides, I'm sure your someone from your generation may have trouble listening to an old man like me. Hahaha~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 273,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "text" : "[Father Rubalkabara]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 274,
      "npc" : "Ascetic",
      "text" : "Still, lessons may come from the places you'd least expect. God loves to teach his children in strange ways. You'll see."
